# Written by the vendored check in vendor/README.md: the crate is its own workspace root, so
# `cargo check --manifest-path vendor/gpui-pre/Cargo.toml` leaves a lock beside it. Clear that
# file before script/vendor-gpui-pre.py --check, which compares every file.
/vendor/gpui-pre/Cargo.lock
# Stubs for the two fonts the crate's svg_renderer test module includes by relative path
# (vendor/gpui-pre/src/svg_renderer.rs:361-363). The repository carries no assets/ tree of its
# own; these two names are the only paths the runbook's workflow creates.
/assets/fonts/ibm-plex-sans/IBMPlexSans-Regular.ttf
/assets/fonts/lilex/Lilex-Regular.ttf
